          "docs": "Syncs a collection generated from an API specification. This is an asynchronous endpoint that returns an HTTP `202 Accepted` response.\n\n**Note:**\n\n- This endpoint only supports the OpenAPI 2.0, 3.0, and 3.1 specification types.\n- You can only sync collections generated from the given spec ID.\n"
        },
