          "docs": "Creates an API specification in Postman's [Spec Hub](https://learning.postman.com/docs/design-apis/specifications/overview/). Specifications can be single or multi-file.\n\n**Note:**\n- Postman supports OpenAPI (2.0, 3.0, and 3.1), AsyncAPI (2.0 and 3.0), protobuf (2 and 3), GraphQL, and Smithy specifications.\n- If the file path contains a `/` (forward slash) character, then a folder is created. For example, if the path is the `components/schemas.json` value, then a `components` folder is created w"
        },
