                "description": "The path to the file."
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Updates a file for an OpenAPI or protobuf 2 or 3 specification.\n\n**Note:**\n\n- This endpoint does not accept an empty request body. You must pass one of the accepted values.\n- This endpoint does not accept multiple request body properties in a single call. For example, you cannot pass both the `content` and `type` property at the same time.\n- Multi-file specifications can only have one root file.\n- When updating a file type to `ROOT`, the previous root file is updated to the `DEFAULT` file type.\n"
        },
